 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><A NAME="toc70843_10"></A>Risks Associated With Our Equipment Leasing Activities </B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>If a client is in payment default under a lease contract with us, we may incur losses. </I></B></FONT></P>
