<P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>In leasing some types of equipment we may be exposed to environmental tort liability. </I></B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">In leasing some types of equipment, such as transportation assets designed to carry hazardous materials, we may be exposed to
