the proportion of our portfolio that may be invested in pay per use agreements. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><A NAME="toc70843_11"></A>Risks Associated With Our
Equipment Trading and Other Activities </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The risks outlined above in &#147;Risks Associated with our Equipment Leasing
