addition to these risks, the following risks are also applicable: </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>Equipment trading transactions and investments in equipment purchase
options, total lease return swaps, participation agreements or other similar transactions related to equipment may be riskier than equipment lease transactions. </I></B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We may purchase equipment without any concurrent lease agreement or sale agreement being in place. In those transactions, we are
