<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>The depth of the equipment market and exit mechanisms</I>. We will look more favorably upon potential direct or indirect investments in equipment
for which a deep and well-established secondary market exists, or where some other investment exit mechanism is likely to exist. </FONT></P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px">&nbsp;</P>
