<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Our manager will be assigned Macquarie Group staff whose activities are primarily dedicated to the operations of our manager. </FONT></P>
