Group&#146;s other leasing and equipment trading activities. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Separation of Confidential Information </I></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Confidentiality policies and procedures within the Macquarie Group are designed to ensure that data recorded within Macquarie Group
