oversight of those people. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>No Investments by Staff Associated with Our Manager </I></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">As a strategy to avoid potential conflicts of interest between us and employees of the Macquarie Group of Companies, any person who:
