sale of a capital asset if the shares are held by you as a capital asset. Any reduction in your share of non-recourse liabilities, such as might arise as a result of a reduction of your
percentage interest in us upon issuance of additional shares to new or existing members, will be treated as a distribution of cash to you. A portion of any distribution in excess of your tax basis will, however, be recharacterized as ordinary income
