<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">If any property is owned by a partnership, or other entity taxed as a partnership such as us, that has both a tax-exempt entity and a
