<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The principal partnership tax items that may have an impact on your AMTI as a result of investing in us are (1) cost recovery deductions
