<P STYLE="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B>Self-Employment Tax and Unearned Income Tax </B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">You should be aware that under Code Section&nbsp;1402(a)(13), limited partners in limited partnerships are generally not subject to
