<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The offering is made on a minimum/maximum basis. Our initial closing date was March 5, 2010, the date on which we had raised at least
