Acquisition Fees. Acquisition Fees shall not include Acquisition Expenses. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Act&#148; shall mean the Delaware Limited
