<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Adjusted Capital Contribution&#148; means, as to any Member, as determined from time to time, the Member&#146;s Capital
