</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Affiliated Investment&#148; shall mean any Investment in which the Manager, any of its Affiliates or any Program either
