<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Agreement&#148; shall mean this Limited Liability Company Operating Agreement, as the same may hereafter be amended, supplemented
or restated from time to time. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Applicable Redemption Price&#148; shall mean, with respect to any Share, the following
amount (determined as of the date of redemption of such Share): </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(a) during the Offering Period, the lesser of
