<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(b)&nbsp;during&nbsp;the&nbsp;Operating&nbsp;Period,&nbsp;the lesser of (i)&nbsp;$9.50&nbsp;per&nbsp;Share ($9.30 per
