indefinitely due to a physical or mental disability or illness that has existed for a continuous period of at least six months. </FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Asset Management Fee&#148; shall mean the fee payable to the Manager and its Affiliates for actively managing the leasing of the
