are performed by non-Affiliates under the Manager&#146;s supervision); (ii)&nbsp;2% of Gross Rental Payments from Full Payout Leases which contain Net Lease provisions; and (iii)&nbsp;7% of Gross Rental Payments from Equipment for which the Fund
provides services in addition to Equipment management relating to the continued and active operation of the Fund&#146;s Equipment such as, but not limited to, ongoing marketing and re-leasing of Equipment and hiring or arranging for the hiring of
crews or operating personnel for the Fund&#146;s Equipment and similar services; or (b)&nbsp;the amount of fees which are competitive for similar services. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
