<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Cash Flow&#148; shall mean cash on hand derived from operating the Fund and the Sale of Fund Investments and shall include
