<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Consent&#148; shall mean either (a)&nbsp;consent given by vote at a meeting called and held in accordance with the provisions of
