<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">&#147;Fund Minimum Gain&#148; has the same meaning as the term &#147;partnership minimum gain&#148; in Treas. Reg. Sections 1.704-2(b)(2)
