<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(b) the Gross Asset Values of all Fund assets shall be adjusted to equal their respective gross fair market values at such
times as the Members&#146; Capital Accounts are adjusted pursuant to Section&nbsp;3.4(g) hereof; </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(c) the Gross
Asset Value of any Fund asset distributed to any Member shall be the gross fair market value of such asset on the date of distribution; </FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(d) to the extent not otherwise reflected in the Members&#146; Capital Accounts, the Gross Asset Values of Fund assets
