any subscriber who is not accepted by the Manager to become a Member shall be promptly returned, together with any interest earned thereon and without deduction for any Front-End Fees, to such subscriber. In no event shall any Subscription Funds be
held in the Escrow Account or a Qualified Subscription Account for more than one year beyond the Effective Date before either being released to the Fund upon a Closing or returned to the subscriber. Notwithstanding the foregoing, no interest will be
paid on any Subscription Funds returned unless said Subscription Funds have been held in the Escrow Account or any Qualified Subscription Account for at least 21 days. </FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(i) Each Person whose subscription is accepted by the Manager shall be admitted to the Fund as a Member within fifteen
