 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><A NAME="appatoc70843_15"></A>3.3 <B>Fund Capital.</B> </FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(a) No Member shall be paid interest on any Capital Contribution (except any interest earned on Subscription Funds as
