commitments or other obligations of the Fund or for any losses of the Fund. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:0px" ALIGN="center"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><A NAME="appatoc70843_30"></A>ARTICLE 6.
