<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(a) The Manager shall have the sole discretion to determine what portion, if any, of cash on hand shall be invested and
