the end of the Operating Period, the Manager intends to cause the Fund to make, to the extent available, monthly Cash Distributions; provided, however, that the amount of each Cash Distribution shall be computed on a non-cumulative basis (that is,
without increase for any portion of the monthly cash distribution amount computed above which the Fund is unable to make, and without reduction for any cash distributions actually made, in any prior period). </FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(b) Prior to Investor Return, distributions pursuant to this Section&nbsp;6.1 shall be made 1% to the Manager and 99% to
