<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><A NAME="appatoc70843_51"></A>8.6 <B>Redemption of Shares.</B> </FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(a) A Member (other than the Manager or an Affiliated Member) may request that the Fund redeem such Member&#146;s Shares.
