<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(b) No reserves shall be established by the Fund for the redemption of Shares. Funds for the redemption of any Share may
